attlefield, each player sacrifices a creature or planeswalker. Each player who can't discards a card.", 'When Solemn Simulacrum enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\nWhen Solemn Simulacrum dies, you may draw a card.', 'When Thragtusk enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\nWhen Thragtusk leaves the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'When Voice of Many enters the battlefield, draw a card for each opponent who controls fewer creatures than you.', 'When Wildfire Devils enters the battlefield and at the beginning of your upkeep, choose a player at random. That player exiles an instant or sorcery card from their graveyard. Copy that card. You may cast the copy without paying its mana cost.', 'When you cast this spell, create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.', 'Whenever Bloodhall Priest enters the battlefield or attacks, if you have no cards in hand, Bloodhall Priest deals 2 damage to any target.\nMadness {1}{B}{R} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', "Whenever Flamerush Rider attacks, create a token that's a copy of another target attacking creature and that's tapped and attacking. Exile the token at end of combat.\nDash {2}{R}{R} (You may cast this spell for its dash cost. If you do, it gains haste, and it's returned from the battlefield to its owner's hand at the beginning of the next end step.)", 'Whenever Gorgon Recluse blocks or becomes blocked by a nonblack creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.\nMadness {B}{B} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', "Whenever River Kelpie or another permanent enters the battlefield from a graveyard, draw a card.\nWhenever a player casts a spell from a graveyard, draw a card.\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Whenever Scaretiller becomes tapped, choose one —\n• You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped.\n• Return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, it deals damage equal to its power to any target.', 'Whenever a creature with power 3 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', "Whenever a face-down creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.\nWhenever a permanent you control is turned face up, if it's a creature, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain life equal to that creature's toughness.\n{1}{G}{W}, {T}: Populate. (Create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", 'Whenever another creature with power 3 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast a spell from your graveyard, Burning Vengeance deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Whenever you cast a spell from your graveyard, draw a card.', "Whenever you cast a spell, populate. (Create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Guttersnipe deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you cycle or discard a card, you may pay {1}. If you do, each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever you discard a creature card, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\nWhenever you discard a land card, add {B}{B}.\nWhenever you discard a noncreature, nonland card, draw a card.', 'Wind-Scarred Crag enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Wind-Scarred Crag enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Woodland Stream enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may have Clever Impersonator enter the battlefield as a copy of any nonland permanent on the battlefield.', "You may have Wall of Stolen Identity enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield, except it's a Wall in addition to its other types and has defender. When you do, tap the copied creature and it doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as you control Wall of Stolen Identity.", 'You may play an additional land this turn.\nDraw a card.', "Your opponents can't cast spells during combat.\nWhenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, goad each creature that player controls. (Until your next turn, those creatures attack each combat if able and attack a player other than you if able.)", '[+1]: Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.\n[−3]: Draw cards equal to the greatest power among creatures you control.\n[−6]: Create a 6/6 green Wurm creature token for each land you control.', '[+1]: Tap target permanent, then untap another target permanent.\n[−2]: Ral Zarek deals 3 damage to any target.\n[−7]: Flip five coins. Take an extra turn after this one for each coin that comes up heads.', '[+1]: Until your next turn, whenever a creature deals combat damage to Vraska the Unseen, destroy that creature.\n[−3]: Destroy target nonland permanent.\n[−7]: Create three 1/1 black Assassin creature tokens with "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, that player loses the game."', '[+1]: You draw a card and you lose 1 life.\n[−3]: Destroy target creature.\n[−8]: Target opponent gets an emblem with "Whenever a player draws a card, you lose 2 life."', "{1}, {T}, Discard a card: Put a study counter on Grimoire of the Dead.\n{T}, Remove three study counters from Grimoire of the Dead and sacrifice it: Put all creature cards from all graveyards onto the battlefield under your control. They're black Zombies in addition to their other colors and types.", '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Magus of the Wheel: Each player discards their hand, then draws seven cards.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}, {T}: Copy target triggered ability you control. You may choose new targets for the copy. (A triggered ability uses the words "when," "whenever," or "at.")', '{2}, {T}: Create a 0/1 green Egg creature token with defender.\nWhenever an Egg you control dies, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', '{2}{B}: Return Sanitarium Skeleton from your graveyard to your hand.', "{2}{G}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard, then populate. (Create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", "{2}{R}, {T}: Create a token that's a copy of target creature card in your graveyard, except it's an artifact in addition to its other types. It gains haste. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{3}, Sacrifice Burnished Hart: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{3}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice X other creatures: Return X target creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield.\n{5}{B}{B}: Put Champion of Stray Souls on top of your library from your graveyard.', "{4}{G}{W}: Create a 3/3 green Centaur creature token.\n{2}{G}{W}: Populate. (Create a token that's a copy of a creature token you control.)", '{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Doomed Necromancer: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "{T}, Discard a card: Up to one target creature can't be blocked this turn.\nWhenever Key to the City becomes untapped, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add {B} or {R}.\n{B/R}{B/R}{B/R}{B/R}, {T}, Sacrifice Rakdos Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\nBasic landcycling {1} ({1}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Naya Panorama: Search your library for a basic Mountain, Forest, or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}{B}{R}, {T}: Each player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}: Each player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}: Return target commander you own from the battlefield to your hand. Activate only during your turn.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{2}, {T}: Thespian's Stage becomes a copy of target land, except it has this ability.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}: Return Drownyard Temple from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Gargoyle Castle: Create a 3/4 colorless Gargoyle artifact creature token with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Llanowar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast colorless spells. Activate only if you control seven or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Yavimaya Coast deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {U} or {R}.\n{U/R}{U/R}{U/R}{U/R}, {T}, Sacrifice Izzet Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {W} or {U}.\n{W/U}{W/U}{W/U}{W/U}, {T}, Sacrifice Azorius Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you created a token this turn.\n{8}, {T}, Sacrifice Idol of Oblivion: Create a 10/10 colorless Eldrazi creature token.', "{T}: Manifest a card from your hand. (Put that card onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)"]
